'''Daeyalt Essence''' is a rock from which [[Daeyalt shard|Daeyalt shards]] can be [[Mining|mined]]. There are three rocks in the [[Daeyalt essence mine]] with only one active at a time. The active rock switches every 55.2-66 seconds. Inactive rocks cannot be mined.

